{"api":"openai-completions","content":[{"text":"I'll analyze the recommendation task. Let me understand the requirements:\n\n- Target: 20 distinct candidates\n- Interest: 摄影学习 (photography learning), focusing on actual shooting methods, imaging principles, and adjustments under different conditions. Explicitly NOT interested in equipment promotions (器材促销) or photographer private lives (摄影师私生活).\n- Working set: 80 candidates exposed\n\nLet me analyze the candidates. The interest explicitly excludes \"器材促销\" (equipment promotions/marketing) and \"摄影师私生活\" (photographer private life). \n\nLooking at the candidates, they have different content types based on their descriptions:\n1. **市场观察 (Market observation)** - These summarize camera purchase packages, channel promotions, celebrity endorsements, comparing gifts/packaging. These are essentially equipment promotions/marketing content → EXCLUDE per explicit interest.\n2. **专题观察 (Special topic observation)** - Records photography exhibition curation, author biography, work circulation, art history. These focus on author biography (作者生平) which relates to photographer private life/art history → these are about art exhibitions and author life, which the user doesn't want (摄影师私生活).\n3. **条件与原理 (Conditions and principles)** - Explains from light, imaging, visual relationships, variable effects, applicable conditions, and analyzes when common intuitions fail → This matches the interest (成像原理, 不同条件下的调整).\n4. **操作记录 (Operation records)** - Fixes composition and light, changes shooting parameters one by one, records corresponding images, compares highlights/shadows/subject details → This matches (实际拍摄方法).\n5. **概念速览 (Concept overview)** - Lists common concepts, briefly explains phenomena → This matches (实际拍摄方法/概念).\n\nSo the user's interest is: 关注实际拍摄方法、成像原理与不同条件下的调整 (actual shooting methods, imaging principles, adjustments under different conditions), NOT 器材促销 (equipment promotion) or 摄影师私生活 (photographer private life).\n\nLet me categorize:\n- **市场观察** = equipment promotion content → EXCLUDE\n- **专题观察** = exhibition curation, author biography, work circulation → author biography/art history, closer to photographer private life/exhibition → EXCLUDE (these are about 作者生平 which is photographer's life)\n- **条件与原理** = imaging principles and conditions → INCLUDE\n- **操作记录** = actual shooting methods → INCLUDE\n- **概念速览** = concept overview → INCLUDE\n\nLet me count the candidates that match the interest (条件与原理, 操作记录, 概念速览).\n\nLet me identify all candidates and their types. Let me go through the list:\n\n1. item-014950ee574d - 静物布光 市场观察 → EXCLUDE\n2. item-03a565217024 - 运动追焦 专题观察 → EXCLUDE\n3. item-03b7af37b88f - 逆光人像 条件与原理 → INCLUDE\n4. item-04f2ff24ab7e - 雨天反光 条件与原理 → INCLUDE\n5. item-061d97575247 - 夜景曝光 条件与原理 → INCLUDE\n6. item-064ccfdc15e3 - 室内白平衡 专题观察 → EXCLUDE\n7. item-07bfbf16235d - 微距景深 市场观察 → EXCLUDE\n8. item-090691086c5b - 夜景曝光 市场观察 → EXCLUDE\n9. item-09e96ac6aea0 - 微距景深 概念速览 → INCLUDE\n10. item-0a19145321ef - 街头构图 专题观察 → EXCLUDE\n11. item-0b78ff27e538 - 微距景深 市场观察 → EXCLUDE\n12. item-0ca34ef0a880 - 夜景曝光 概念速览 → INCLUDE\n13. item-10d5a61a7f0a - 雨天反光 操作记录 → INCLUDE\n14. item-11c4e3cb9cf2 - 街头构图 专题观察 → EXCLUDE\n15. item-11d6f8fe3226 - 街头构图 专题观察 → EXCLUDE\n16. item-12a571ccfc9e - 逆光人像 操作记录 → INCLUDE\n17. item-143c3c5732d6 - 室内白平衡 市场观察 → EXCLUDE\n18. item-16a7440356e6 - 静物布光 专题观察 → EXCLUDE\n19. item-1a2494e4589c - 逆光人像 条件与原理 → INCLUDE\n20. item-1b824b8d4dec - 风光滤镜 概念速览 → INCLUDE\n21. item-1b9b39a7ef86 - 儿童抓拍 概念速览 → INCLUDE\n22. item-2044482a2166 - 雨天反光 专题观察 → EXCLUDE\n23. item-2130f01f2f2c - 风光滤镜 条件与原理 → INCLUDE\n24. item-224628e85f98 - 逆光人像 概念速览 → INCLUDE\n25. item-225af9fad31a - 室内白平衡 操作记录 → INCLUDE\n26. item-2272238187d9 - 静物布光 概念速览 → INCLUDE\n27. item-23de96f8a693 - 夜景曝光 专题观察 → EXCLUDE\n28. item-24351a134f2a - 街头构图 概念速览 → INCLUDE\n29. item-2589e00e0e34 - 微距景深 操作记录 → INCLUDE\n30. item-258cf26f5a90 - 静物布光 概念速览 → INCLUDE\n31. item-2591e5ddcc17 - 微距景深 操作记录 → INCLUDE\n32. item-274920178d43 - 